ecked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(D\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CEA}(D,\\varnothing\\prime)\">\\(\\operatorname{CEA}(D,\\varnothing\\prime)\\)</span>明确包含∅′≤TD。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CEA}\">\\(\\operatorname{CEA}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}\\)</span>、跳跃与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2d6a8203c0121eb0\" href=\"?note=2d6a8203c0121eb0\" title=\"43-df-cea\">43-df-cea</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CEA}(D,\\varnothing\\prime)\\Rightarrow\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land A\\prime\\equiv_TD).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CEA}(D,\\varnothing\\prime)\\Rightarrow\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land A\\prime\\equiv_TD).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源只给证明纲要，本原子据其核对陈述，不将纲要误写为已完整检查的机器证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.13.4, print p.56 / PDF p.76。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id"